job_listings.job_highlights_text:
Advanced degree (MS/PhD) in AI related discipline or pharmaceutical development related discipline (e.g. bioinformatics, biostatistics) plus 5+ years of relevant post-degree work experience
Domain experience applying AI in the context of biomedical research and/or drug development and/or medical affairs and evidence generation;
Experience developing solutions for AI areas of interest (e.g., supervised and unsupervised ML, NLP, Generative AI, LLMs, reinforcement learning, graph-based learning, etc.) in industry and / or academic settings;
Experience presenting work at conferences and publishing;
Excellent critical thinking and problem-solving skills;
Strong attention to detail;
High motivation, good work ethic and maturity
Relevant domain knowledge encompassing areas such as life sciences, research & development, healthcare, health technology, or related expertise/experience
An on-line application, including a full set of transcripts (official or unofficial), is required

